==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|annélidé}}, coined by French naturalist [[w:Lamarck|Lamarck]].

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# any of various [[worm]]like animals, of the [[phylum]] [[Annelida]], having a [[segment]]ed body; they include the [[earthworm]] and the [[leech]]

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|segmented worm}}

